{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b87","chatId":"3eb08cf06f0645c2bd880f99b655afd8","sessionId":null,"userId":67926,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1026,"promptTokens":1490,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:25"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574254792153665,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b86","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369685929,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b86","chatId":"3eb08cf06f0645c2bd880f99b655afd8","sessionId":null,"userId":67926,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n凯瑟琳是一位年轻有抱负的音乐家，她在找寻自己的声音时遇到了困难，经常模仿流行歌手的风格。然而，她讨厌模仿别人，想要保持原创性。有一天在一次现场演出中，她像她最喜欢的艺术家那样完美唱出了一个高音，观众为她鼓掌欢呼。听到观众的欢呼声，凯瑟琳的眼睛充满了泪水。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，凯瑟琳最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 失望\nB) 愧疚\nC) 激动\nD) 嫉妒\nE) 感激\nF) 伤心\n\n## 问题 2\n凯瑟琳为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她最喜欢的艺术家没有参加她的演出\nB) 她在一大群人面前演出的很好\nC) 她觉得她没表演好\nD) 她因为模仿别的艺术家的风格而被赞赏","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574254792153665,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e895d6006945d2809b87","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369685926,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"cf212b3b6c2f4691966d001d321e3c91"}